source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A color macro keeps the line domain, so the pair inside it breaks; jiro reads a hard break inside the color.
-- input.jira --
{color:red}a\\b{color}
-- rendered.html --
<p><font color="red">a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />b</font></p>
-- want.md --
<font color="red">a\
b</font>
-- warnings.json --
[]
